# Backend Architecture Rules

Use Python + FastAPI + Pydantic + SQLAlchemy + Alembic + Redis + Celery.

Layering: API Route -> Schema -> Service -> Repository -> Model.

Do not swallow exceptions silently. Do not log secrets.
